<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>London Metal Gigs - upcoming metal and hardcore shows in London</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Upcoming metal, hardcore and heavy gigs in London, listed by date and updated daily. Covering the Underworld, the Black Heart, the Dev, Helgi's and more.">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://metalgigs.london/">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d0d0f">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="London Metal Gigs">
    <meta property="og:title" content="London Metal Gigs">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Upcoming metal, hardcore and heavy gigs in London, listed by date and updated daily. Covering the Underworld, the Black Heart, the Dev, Helgi's and more.">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://metalgigs.london/">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://metalgigs.london/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" sizes="48x48 32x32 16x16">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: dark;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
            background: #0d0d0f;
            color: #e6e6e6;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        }
        main {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #9a9a9a;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #26262a;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
        }
        .gigs-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.25rem;
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .gig-card {
            background: #18181b;
            border: 1px solid #26262a;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .gig-image {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            object-fit: cover;
            background: #26262a;
        }
        .gig-card a {
            display: block;
            position: relative;
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .gig-card a:hover .gig-title {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        /* Two-tone, because the link wraps the poster and one colour is only guaranteed to show
           against some artwork. Drawn as an overlay rather than as the link's own outline and inset
           shadow: an inset shadow paints below child content, so the dark half of the ring would sit
           behind the very image it exists to stand out against. Inside the card rather than around
           it, because .gig-card clips whatever leaves its rounded box. The transparent outline is
           what leaves a focus ring in forced-colors mode, where shadows aren't painted at all. */
        .gig-card a:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid transparent;
            outline-offset: -6px;
        }
        .gig-card a:focus-visible::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            /* the card's 10px, less the 1px border this sits inside */
            border-radius: 9px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #0d0d0f, inset 0 0 0 6px #f2f2f2;
        }
        /* Spans rather than divs so one link can wrap the whole card without nesting block-level
           content in it, so they need laying out as blocks explicitly. */
        .gig-info {
            display: block;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem 1rem;
        }
        .gig-title {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            color: #f2f2f2;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .gig-venue {
            display: block;
            color: #a1a1aa;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <h1>London Metal Gigs</h1>
    
    <h2>Saturday, 8 August 2026</h2>
    <ul class="gigs-grid">
        
        <li class="gig-card">
            <a href="https://example.com/gigs/early-gig-one">
                <img class="gig-image" src="images/2026-08-08-venue-a-e8f74dd6.webp" alt="" loading="lazy">
                <span class="gig-info">
                    <span class="gig-title">Early Gig One</span>
                    <span class="gig-venue">Venue A</span>
                </span>
            </a>
        </li>
        
        <li class="gig-card">
            <a href="https://example.com/gigs/early-gig-two">
                <img class="gig-image" src="images/2026-08-08-venue-b-40b1a885.webp" alt="" loading="lazy">
                <span class="gig-info">
                    <span class="gig-title">Early Gig Two</span>
                    <span class="gig-venue">Venue B</span>
                </span>
            </a>
        </li>
        
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Tuesday, 1 September 2026</h2>
    <ul class="gigs-grid">
        
        <li class="gig-card">
            <a href="https://example.com/gigs/late-gig">
                <img class="gig-image" src="images/2026-09-01-venue-a-1c8f1c82.webp" alt="" loading="lazy">
                <span class="gig-info">
                    <span class="gig-title">Late Gig</span>
                    <span class="gig-venue">Venue A</span>
                </span>
            </a>
        </li>
        
    </ul>
    
</main>
</body>
</html>
